{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07329","headline":"同郭参谋咏崔仆射淮南节度使厅前竹 · 刘长卿","name":"同郭参谋咏崔仆射淮南节度使厅前竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔种梁王苑，今移汉将坛。\n蒙笼低冕过，青翠卷帘看。\n得地移根远，经霜抱节难。\n开花成凤实，嫩笋长鱼竿。\n蔼蔼军容静，萧萧郡宇宽。\n细音和角暮，疎影上门寒。\n湘浦何年变，山阳几处残。\n不知轩屏侧，岁晚对袁安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07329.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07329","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}